# Machine-local Postgres overrides are intentionally NOT tracked -- they exist
# to let one developer dial the baked defaults down for their hardware. A
# change that should apply to everyone belongs in a --build-arg in
# docker-compose.test.yml instead, where git can see it.
#
# README.md and this file stay tracked so the directory exists in a fresh
# clone: `include_dir` on a MISSING directory is a FATAL startup error.
*.conf
